{{en-noun}}

# A tailless [[rodent]] of the [[family]] {{taxfmt|Caviidae|family}} and the [[genus]] {{taxfmt|Cavia|genus}}, with short [[ear]]s and larger than a [[hamster]]; the [[species]] {{taxfmt|Cavia porcellus|species}} is often kept as a [[pet]].
#: {{syn|en|cavy|q1=formal name}}
# A rodent of any of several species within the family Caviidae.
# {{lb|en|figuratively}} A living experimental subject.
