# {{lb|en|nautical|obsolete}} A [[midshipman]] in the East India service; {{i|by extension}} a low-skilled or non-proficient [[seaman]].
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1748|author=w:Tobias Smollett|title=w:The Adventures of Roderick Random|page=183|url=https://books.google.com/books?id=Sj9jAAAAcAAJ&pg=PA183&dq=%22none+of+your+guinea+pigs%22&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwiCloOq-JzRAhVSgCYKHVguCWgQ6AEImgEwHQ#v=onepage&q=%22none%20of%20your%20guinea%20pigs%22&f=false|passage=A good seaman he is... none of your '''guinea-pigs'''.}}
#* '''1779''', Macintosh, ''Travels'', quoted in Carey, Old Days, i. 73
#*: I promise you, to me it was no slight penance to be exposed during the whole voyage to the half sneering, satirical looks of the mates and '''guinea-pigs'''.

